cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Gene Stratigraphy Pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A pipeline for stratifying genes by phylogenetic depth of origin from
  OrthoFinder's Hierarchical Orthogroups output, producing candidate
  lineage-specific genes cross-checked against OrthoFinder's flat
  Orthogroups and pairwise Orthologues outputs. Stage 2 of the LINGUA
  comparative genomics framework, developed as part of dissertation work
  on the identification and evolutionary analysis of de novo genes (DNGs).
authors:
